      "created_at": "2026-02-03T17:28:17.006Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Team,</p>\n<p>We work in a service industry where we have multiple projects. So I use multiple warehouse to keep track of inventory purchased at client’s location and once our work is done. We move stock to our godown. Now client’s warehouse are temporary in nature and we only use them during the lifecycle of the project.</p>\n<p><strong>Ask:</strong> I want to restrict/disable warehouse such that once it has been disabled (i.e. work is completed). No transaction can take place in it i.e. no purchase/sale/stock entry. This is to reduce user error.</p>",
